# The XR surroundings: a living room by night with the room fully showing through, then day and back to the
# app's own space; the app keeps working through each change.
open!
wait id=title 30
xr env night
xr passthrough 1
press id=greet
expect text="Hello, stranger"
screenshot xr-night
xr env day
xr passthrough 0.5
expect id=title
xr passthrough 0
expect id=title
